# Path to Launch 🚀

### Week 1: Core Features

1. Order System [CRITICAL]
   - [✓] Stripe integration
     - [✓] Basic checkout flow
     - [✓] Webhook handling
     - [✓] Payment processing
   - [ ] Order fulfillment flow [IN PROGRESS]
     - [ ] Mark logo as sold
     - [ ] Deliver files to customer
     - [ ] Send confirmation email
   - [ ] Basic analytics

2. Email System [HIGH]
   - [ ] Essential templates [NEXT]
     - [ ] Order confirmation
     - [ ] Logo approval notification
   - [ ] Email delivery testing

### Week 2: Testing & Launch Prep

1. Testing [CRITICAL]
   - [ ] Core functionality tests
   - [ ] Payment flow testing
   - [ ] Load testing
   - [ ] Security testing

2. Launch Preparation [CRITICAL]
   - [ ] SSL setup
   - [ ] Database backup
   - [ ] Monitoring setup
   - [ ] Documentation
     - [ ] User guide
     - [ ] Admin guide

3. Launch Day
   - [ ] Final checks
   - [ ] System monitoring
   - [ ] 🚀 Launch

# Critical Dependencies

1. [✓] Stripe integration must be completed before launch
2. Email system must be functional
3. Core testing must pass

# Daily Monitoring

1. System Health
   - API availability
   - Database health
   - Payment processing

2. Business Metrics
   - Orders
   - Revenue
   - Error rates

# Emergency Procedures

1. System Issues
   - Rollback procedure
   - Support contacts

2. Payment Issues
   - [✓] Stripe dashboard monitoring
   - [✓] Payment support contacts